    "title": "West Palm Beach approves speed cameras in over 20 school zones - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Tiffany Rizzo ,\n1 days ago WEST PALM BEACH, Fla. (CBS12) — Speeding drivers in West Palm Beach will soon face new enforcement as city leaders move to crack down in school zones. On Monday night, the West Palm Beach City Commission voted unanimously to install speed cameras in more than 20 school zones across the city. Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak 1",
